# Temporary scratch/test/debug scripts
# NOTE: test_*.py is NOT ignored — Frappe's bench test runner requires that
# exact filename prefix for real doctype/module tests (msuite/tests/test_*.py,
# */doctype/*/test_*.py). Ignoring it silently drops the whole test suite
# from version control. Ad-hoc scratch scripts should use debug_/scratch_/tmp_.
debug_*.py
scratch_*.py
tmp_*.py

